Run specific tasks

Usage: mk run [OPTIONS] [TASK_NAME]

Arguments:
  [TASK_NAME]  The task name to run

Options:
      --dry-run         Print the resolved task plan without executing commands
      --force           Bypass task cache and force execution
      --json-events     Emit newline-delimited JSON execution events
  -F, --fzf             Choose task with fuzzy finder before execution
      --label <FILTER>  Run tasks matching label (KEY or KEY=VALUE). Repeatable; all must match.
  -h, --help            Print help
  -V, --version         Print version
